stionsEnabled":true,"minSuggestCharacters":1,"withinViewEnabled":false,"zoomScale":null,"popupTemplate":null,"popupEnabled":true,"_uid":"8be4da053b8"}],"activeSourceIndex":-1},"keyboardShortcutsPosition":1000,"compassWidgetPosition":1000,"sharePosition":{"position":"top-right","index":0},"measureDistancePosition":1000,"locateWidgetPosition":1000,"bookmarksPosition":1000,"homePosition":0,"legendPosition":1000,"mapZoomPosition":1,"languageSwitcherPosition":1000,"basemapTogglePosition":1000,"layerListPosition":1000,"fullScreenPosition":1000,"scalebarPosition":{"position":"bottom-right","index":1},"mapA11yDesc":"Map of Riverside County, showing the location of Vote Centers for the November 2026 General Election.","keyboardShortcuts":false,"introductionTitle":"","showIntroduction":false,"introductionContent":"<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Verdana; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:center; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;\"><div class=\"WACEditing EditMode EditingSurfaceBody FireFox WACViewPanel_DisableLegacyKeyCodeAndCharCode usehover\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\" id=\"WACViewPanel_ClipboardElement\"><div class=\"SCXW227284761 BCX2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size:18pt;\"><strong>November 4, 2025, Statewide Special Election&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size:18pt;\"><strong>Official Vote Center Locations</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center;\"><strong>You may vote in person at any Riverside County vote centers. There will be a 29-Day vote center open at the Registrar of Voters headquarters starting October 6, 2025 through Election Day, November 4, 2025.&nbsp;</strong></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5pt;\"><strong>There will also be 11-Day vote centers open from October 25, 2025 through Election Day, November 4</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center;\"><strong>, 2025</strong></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5pt;\"><strong>, and 4-Day vote centers open from&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center;\"><strong>November 1, 2025</strong></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5pt;\"><strong> through&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center;\"><strong>November 4, 2025</strong></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5pt;\"><strong>. For the complete list of vote centers and hours of operation, please visit our website </strong></span></span><a href=\"https://www.voteinfo.net\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5pt;\"><strong>www.voteinfo.net</strong></span></span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin:1em 0px 0in;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>All active registered voters in the County of Riverside will automatically receive a Vote-by-Mail ballot in the mail. Voted ballots must be received by an Elections Official no later than the close of polls on Election Day or be postmarked on or before Election Day and received no later than 7 days after Election Day to be counted.</strong></span></i></span><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:14px;\"><strong>To find the closest vote center, you may (1) type in your address, (2) click on the map near your approximate location, or (3) search by vote center name.</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><br>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:none; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:Verdana; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; margin:0px 0px 0px 40px; padding:0px; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div class=\"WACEditing EditMode EditingSurfaceBody FireFox WACViewPanel_DisableLegacyKeyCodeAndCharCode usehover\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"SCXW227284761 BCX2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;\"><strong>1</strong>.Type in your address and you will be provided the closest vote center. Click on the Directions tab and the best route to the vote center will be provided. If you choose, you can print the directions and the map.</span></font></span></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div class=\"WACEditing EditMode EditingSurfaceBody FireFox WACViewPanel_DisableLegacyKeyCodeAndCharCode usehover\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"SCXW227284761 BCX2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;\"><strong>2</strong>. If you do not know the address, but your approximate location, clicking on the map will provide an address and the closest vote center. If you choose, you can print the directions and the map. Change the Results Slider to increase or decrease the search radius.</span></font></span></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div class=\"WACEditing EditMode EditingSurfaceBody FireFox WACViewPanel_DisableLegacyKeyCodeAndCharCode usehover\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"SCXW227284761 BCX2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.7px; margin:1em 0px 0in; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;\"><strong>3</strong>. If you know the name of the vote center, simply type in the vote center name in the search box located in the upper right corner. Or type in the first few letters of the site and click the magnifier button and any matching sites will drop down.</span></font></s